  "description": "First-floor extension to the side/front, along with a two-storey rear extension (wrap-around), conversion of the existing garage into a habitable room, and Outside building\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\ndevelopment would result in the loss of an Oak tree which is the subject of a Tree Preservation Order.&amp;nbsp; No details have been provided regarding its type, health, category or justification for its loss. Therefore, the proposal would be contrary to The National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the\r\nLondon Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012),\r\npolicy DM 1 and DM22 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan\r\n(2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design\r\nGuide (2010) and GR1 of the Draft Harrow Local Plan. &amp;nbsp;&lt;font face=&quot;Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
